<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Lien invalide</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        body { margin:0; font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif; background:#f1f5f9; padding:40px 16px; text-align:center; color:#1e293b; }
        .card { background:#fff; border-radius:16px; box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08); max-width:420px; margin:0 auto; padding:36px 26px; }
        .ic { font-size:52px; color:#dc2626; margin-bottom:14px; }
        h1 { font-size:20px; color:#1e1b4b; margin:0 0 8px; }
        p { color:#475569; font-size:15px; margin:0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
    <div class="ic"><i class="fas fa-circle-exclamation"></i></div>
    <h1>Lien invalide ou expiré</h1>
    <p>Ce lien de réponse n'est plus valable. Contactez l'administration si besoin.</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
